OL,3,GLondon & South East                    
OL,5,CThis Evening and Tonight:FMany places  
OL,6,Fdry this evening with clear spells.    
OL,7,FPerhaps the odd light shower affecting 
OL,8,Fsouthern counties. Turning cloudy in   
OL,9,Fthe west overnight with strengthening  
OL,10,Fwinds and patchy rain developing       
OL,11,Facross Hampshire by dawn. Staying dry  
OL,12,Felsewhere with largely clear skies.    
OL,14,CSunday:FA cloudy start in the south    
OL,15,Fand west with a chance of light rain   
OL,16,Ffor a time, clearing later. Otherwise, 
OL,17,Fa bright, but rather breezy day.       
OL,18,FTemperatures around average.           
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
