OL,3,GLondon & South East                    
OL,5,COutlook for Monday to Wednesday:FPartly
OL,6,Fcloudy with isolated showers on        
OL,7,FMonday. Cloudier during Tuesday with   
OL,8,Fstrengthening winds and rain in the    
OL,9,Fwest. Cloudy and breezy with rain on   
OL,10,FWednesday. Temperatures slightly below 
OL,11,Faverage.                               
